		(uuid "6c7f0dad-6869-46a1-9177-0a1e54dd68af")
	)
	(text "5 V motor / encoder supply branches BEFORE this sheet.\nAdafruit BNO085 breakout: 3.3 V rail to VIN; 3Vo is an output, leave separate.\nBare BNO085: connect 3.3 V to VDD and VDDIO with its specified decoupling."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 60.96 179.07 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "772dc22b-ec44-4913-9a25-3bc7d65de495")
	)
	(text "Layout: capacitors close to U1; EP pad 9 to GND copper and thermal vias.\nHeat at 1 A: about 1.7 W at 5 V input; verify junction temperature on final PCB."
